<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑγᾰλόεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glossy, glittering</i>, 
				Ep.
			
			Adj.: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of
			apparel, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. χιτών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.60
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.232
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἵματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.154
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήγεα</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.468
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοσίγαλος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of horses' reins,
				<i>glittering</i> with colour or metal work, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.226
			</span></i>, etc.; of house-furniture, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.86
				</span></i>
			; of a queen's chamber, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερώϊα σιγαλόεντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.449
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				18.206
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηὸν [σιγ]αλόεντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1026
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fatty, oily</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμύγδαλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					63.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.295c
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
